#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:3
#: 4c89c2cedc394cd9b2b242f69f9f78ae
msgid "Testing new releases and updates"
msgstr "測試新發行版與更新"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:7
#: feac230c1d2444a690d6a0af3053cf87
msgid "This page is intended for advanced users."
msgstr "此頁面適用於進階使用者。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:9
#: 2c32bd135ad7475b844fd2d0673f1a86
msgid ""
"Testing new Qubes OS releases and updates is one of the most helpful ways in "
"which you can :doc:`contribute </introduction/contributing>` to the Qubes OS "
"Project. If you’re interested in helping with this, please `join the testing "
"team <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/joining-the-testing-team/5190>`__. There "
"are several different types of testing, which we’ll cover below."
msgstr ""
"測試新的 Qubes OS 發行版與更新是您向 Qubes OS 專案\\ :doc:`貢獻 </"
"introduction/contributing>`\\ 最有幫助的方式之一。如果您有興趣協助，請\\ `加"
"入測試團隊 <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/joining-the-testing-"
"team/5190>`__\\ 。以下我們將介紹幾種不同類型的測試。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:11
#: 94af1fe2a5954e80a74ab7b99cab362c
msgid ""
"**Warning:** Software testing is intended for advanced users and developers. "
"You should only attempt to do this if you know what you’re doing. Never rely "
"on code that is in testing for critical work!"
msgstr ""
"**警告：** 軟體測試適用於進階使用者和開發人員。只有當您知道自己在做什麼時才應"
"嘗試。切勿在關鍵工作中依賴處於測試階段的程式碼！"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:14
#: 778b63d6fbe94315b7905bb8e248da7b
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "發行版"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:17
#: e5e03c5453a146a38b0b5b24d119f557
msgid "How to test upcoming Qubes OS releases:"
msgstr "如何測試即將推出的 Qubes OS 發行版："

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:19
