"（RC）（如果目前有的話）。（或從我們的 `FTP 伺服器 <https://ftp.qubes-os.org/"
"iso/>`__\\ 嘗試較舊的 RC。）"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:21
#: 3e28d962f2264714baa98b522de65365
msgid ""
"Try the `signed weekly builds <https://qubes.notset.fr/iso/>`__. (`Learn "
"more <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/16929>`__ and `track their status "
"<https://github.com/fepitre/updates-status-iso/issues>`__.)"
msgstr ""
"嘗試\\ `經過簽署的每週建置 <https://qubes.notset.fr/iso/>`__\\ 。（\\ `了解更"
"多 <https://forum.qubes-os.org/t/16929>`__\\ 並\\ `追蹤其狀態 <https://"
"github.com/fepitre/updates-status-iso/issues>`__\\ 。）"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:23
#: 8cf22449dc3743d28998b6bf5eb03a2f
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`qubes-builder </developer/building/qubes-builder-v2>` to build the "
"latest release yourself."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`qubes-builder </developer/building/qubes-builder-v2>` 自行建置最新"
"的發行版。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:25
#: 0719ebd9d8b94154b68d5ac7cd286eee
msgid ""
"(No support) Experiment with developer alpha ISOs found from time to time at "
"`Qubes OpenQA <https://openqa.qubes-os.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"（無支援）偶爾在 `Qubes OpenQA <https://openqa.qubes-os.org/>`__ 上嘗試開發"
"者 alpha ISO。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:29
#: 37fc03cf8a404a5dabf360c554bb752b
msgid ""
"Please make sure to :doc:`report any bugs you encounter </introduction/issue-"
