"testing repositories>`。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:45
#: 15b4b524a16a44c59d54eed31728093b
msgid ""
"Every new update is first uploaded to the ``security-testing`` repository if "
"it is a security update or ``current-testing`` if it is a normal update. The "
"update remains in ``security-testing`` or ``current-testing`` for a minimum "
"of one week. On occasion, an exception is made for a particularly critical "
"security update, which is immediately pushed to the ``current`` stable "
"repository. In general, however, security updates remain in ``security-"
"testing`` for two weeks before migrating to ``current``. Normal updates "
"generally remain in ``current-testing`` until they have been sufficiently "
"tested by the community, which can last weeks or even months, depending on "
"the amount of feedback received (see :ref:`user/downloading-installing-"
"upgrading/testing:providing feedback`)."
msgstr ""
"每個新更新首先會上傳到 ``security-testing`` 儲存庫（如果是安全性更新）或 "
"``current-testing``（如果是一般更新）。該更新會在 ``security-testing`` 或 "
"``current-testing`` 中保留至少一週。有時，對於特別關鍵的安全性更新會有例外，"
"會立即推送至 ``current`` 穩定儲存庫。但一般來說，安全性更新會在 ``security-"
"testing`` 中保留兩週，然後才遷移至 ``current``。一般更新通常會留在 ``current-"
"testing`` 中，直到社群充分測試為止，這可能持續數週甚至數月，具體取決於收到的"
"回饋數量（請參閱 :ref:`user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing:"
"providing feedback`）。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:47
#: a3f63c52bb7649abb9d83e476b822478
msgid ""
"“Sufficient testing” is, in practice, a fluid term that is up the "
"developers’ judgment. In general, it means either that no negative feedback "
"and at least one piece of positive feedback has been received or that the "
"package has been in ``current-testing`` for long enough, depending on the "
"component and the complexity of the changes."
msgstr ""
"「充分測試」在實務上是一個靈活的術語，取決於開發人員的判斷。一般來說，它表示"
"要麼沒有收到負面回饋且至少收到一條正面回饋，要麼該套件在 ``current-testing`` "
"中的時間已經足夠長——具體取決於元件和變更的複雜度。"

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:49
#: da09b5c288f9438fa0ccbefdff6577d2
msgid ""
"A limitation of the current testing setup is that it is only possible to "
"migrate the *most recent version* of a package from ``current-testing`` to "
"``current``. This means that, if a newer version of a package is uploaded to "
"``current-testing``, it will no longer be possible to migrate any older "
"versions of that same package from ``current-testing`` to ``current``, even "
"if one of those older versions has been deemed stable enough. While this "
"limitation can be inconvenient, the benefits outweigh the costs, since it "
"greatly simplifies the testing and reporting process."
msgstr ""
"目前測試設定的一個限制是，只能將套件的\\ *最新版本*\\ 從 ``current-testing`` "
"遷移至 ``current``。這意味著，如果某個套件的較新版本上傳到 ``current-"
"testing``，則無法再將同一套件的任何較舊版本從 ``current-testing`` 遷移至 "
"``current``，即使其中某個較舊版本已被認為足夠穩定。雖然這個限制可能帶來不便，"
"但其好處大於成本，因為它大大簡化了測試和回報流程。"

